      "id": "concept:retry-policy",
      "label": "Retry policy",
      "summary": "The runner requeues a failed job while `attempts <= MaxRetries`, with a delay of `BaseDelay * 2^(attempts-1)` capped at `MaxDelay`. When the last retry fails too, the runner dead-letters the job.",
      "anchors": [
        {
